CLASS com/charlesproxy/model/class_933 com/charlesproxy/model/Flow__Data
	COMMENT One bandwidth bucket returned by Flow.getData(); NestHost is Flow. The constructor is called with (bucketStart, bucketEnd, dataSize) straight out of Flow's three parallel arrays, and FlowChartPanel plots dataSize * 1000 / (1 + bucketEnd - bucketStart) as bytes per second.
